{"t":"Hive Born World Change","s":"hive-born-world-change-f1717","k":"quest","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hive Born World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(150 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Change</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">War Against the Hive</a> is being fought. If the Hive is weakened, it may be possible to advance further into it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Quirefang\">Quirefang</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>All <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Born\">Hive Born</a> creatures.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Access to the inner <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Born\">Hive Born</a>, possibility to complete the <a href=\"#/quest/insectoid-outfits-quest\">Insectoid Outfits Quest</a> and also to tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Ladybug\">Ladybug</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\nIf enough actions against the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Born\">Hive Born</a> are taken, its defenses may be breached and access to the inner Hive will be opened. In order to change the Hive stage, tasks of the <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">War Against the Hive Quest</a> must be completed. This World Change have three possible stages which change at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a> of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Game%20Worlds\">Game World</a>:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Stage_1\">Stage 1</span></h2>\n<p>This is the default stage and the Hive will remain this way unless actions against it are taken. There are 4 different <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">tasks</a> which can be done, each one being worth one point. The server needs 200 total points in a single day to advance to the second stage. \n</p><p>Players can check the current stage by asking <a href=\"#/wiki/Informer%20NPCs\">Guide NPCs</a> about the <b>hive</b> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Orockle\">Orockle</a> about <b>status</b>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hive<br/>\nGuide NPC: The hive is well defended and prepared for war. ...<br/>\nGuide NPC: <i>X</i> actions have been taken against the Hive Born. 200 actions are necessary to advance further into the hive.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hive Born World Change</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Stage_2\">Stage 2</span></h2>\n<p>During the second stage, the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33588,31235,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">eastern part (33588, 31235, 7)</a> of the inner Hive becomes accessible. During this stage there are two other <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">tasks</a> that can be completed and are worth 2 points each. In order to advance to the next and final stage, another 200 actions are necessary. If this is not done after 3 days, the Hive will return to the first stage. \n</p><p>At this stage it's also possible to enter some reward rooms to obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/Gooey%20Mass\">Gooey Masses</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Insectoid%20Cell\">Insectoid Cells</a>. Note that in order to enter the rooms you need to speak to <a href=\"#/wiki/Orockle\">Orockle</a> (<i>reward</i>, <i>yes</i>) and spend 50 Favour Points of the quest (gained through completing the tasks). Orockle will use a special pheromone on you that allows you to go through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Gate\">Hive Gates</a> on all floors for 7 days. \n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hive<br/>\nGuide NPC: The defences of the hive are breached. The hive structure to the east is open. ...<br/>\nGuide NPC: <i>X</i> actions have been taken against the Hive Born. 200 actions are necessary to advance further into the hive.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hive Born World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p>Or if the number of actions taken is at least 200:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nGuide NPC: The defences of the hive are breached. The hive structure to the east is open. ...<br/>\nGuide NPC: <i>X</i> actions have been taken against the Hive Born. Enough to advance even further into the hive.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hive Born World Change</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Stage_3\">Stage 3</span></h2>\n<p>During this stage, the Hive is completely exposed and the western side of the inner Hive is also accessible. If you have the pheromone from Orockle, you'll have access to other reward rooms with <a href=\"#/wiki/Gooey%20Mass\">Gooey Masses</a> as well as the room of the <a href=\"#/quest/insectoid-outfits-quest\">Insectoid Outfits Quest</a>. The western side is also home of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hive%20Born\">Hive Born Bosses</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Chopper\">Chopper</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fleshslicer\">Fleshslicer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Maw\">Maw</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mindmasher\">Mindmasher</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotspit\">Rotspit</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowstalker\">Shadowstalker</a> which may drop <a href=\"#/wiki/Dung%20Ball%20%28Quest%29\">special Dung Balls</a> worth 10 War Exp. of the <a href=\"#/quest/war-against-the-hive-quest\">War Against the Hive Quest</a> each. Finally, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ladybug\">Ladybugs</a> may also be found on the ground floor of the Hive during this stage.\n</p><p><b>This stage lasts 5 days</b>, after which it reverts to stage 1. If at least 200 actions were taken during the final day of stage 3, it will revert to stage 2 instead. \n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hive<br/>\nGuide NPC: The hives defences have fallen. Its armies are confused and in shambles. All structures are open for invaders. ...<br/>\nGuide NPC: <i>X</i> actions have been taken against the Hive Born. This position will hold for a while.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hive Born World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p>On the last day of stage 3:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hive<br/>\nGuide NPC: The hives defences have fallen. Its armies are confused and in shambles. All structures are open for invaders. ...<br/>\nGuide NPC: <i>X</i> actions have been taken against the Hive Born. It is impossible to hold this position any longer, however.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hive Born World Change</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["insectoid-outfits-quest","war-against-the-hive-quest"]}